        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the NordicTrack Commercial 1750 worth the price?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              For most home users who want a genuinely sturdy, full-size deck
              and don't mind an iFit subscription after the included first
